        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86194, 36 Inch Round Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Stainless Steel 36 Inch Round Door Pull has a 1-1/8 inch grip that is big enough to handle heavier doors without looking bulky. This stainless steel door pull has 24 inch mounting centers. It will fit most standard doors that are 1-3/4 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick. Choose from thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, or back to back mounting. The 36 Inch Round Door Pull is available in a few contemporary finish color options. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86194-Specifications.gif?v=1704354749\" width=\"600\" height=\"127\" boarder=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek 86194 Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in Other Lengths \r\n<a href=\"/products/24-inch-round-door-pull-emtek-86193\"><b>24\" Door Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-48-inch-round-door-pull-emtek-86189\"><b>48\" Door Pull</b></a>, or\r\n<a href=\"/products/72-inch-stainless-steel-round-door-pull-emtek-86190\"><b>72\" Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek 86194 Contemporary Round 36 Inch Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\" </li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/4\" (with rosette)</li>\r\n<li>Tubing Diameter: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door. Packaged with  Decorative Screw Cover Caps.</li>\r\n<li><b>Concealed Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. Comes as a set of 2 pulls.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Long-Pulls-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354641\" width=\"585\" height=\"179\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Long Pull Finishes\">\r\n</p>",
